message: "If you use CRED-1, please cite both the paper (doi:10.2139/ssrn.6448466) and the dataset version you used (concept doi:10.5281/zenodo.18769459)."
title: "CRED-1: An Open Multi-Signal Domain Credibility Dataset"
abstract: "Domain-level credibility ratings for news and information domains, aggregated from public source-rating initiatives and scored on a 0 to 1 scale from editorial classification, fact-check claims, web popularity and domain age. Ships as a dataset, a JavaScript library, a CLI and an MCP server."
